## Why CC BY-SA?

- It allows the translation to spread and be adapted (including for printed
  Bibles, classroom use, derivative paraphrases).
- ShareAlike ensures derivative works remain freely available, preventing
  enclosure of the translation into closed commercial products.
- It mirrors the spirit of major open content projects (Wikipedia, OpenStreetMap).

